    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the streets of Rabat in <i>Hood Tales Part 1: Morocco</i>. Follow the journey of a young artist trying to escape the hood through music, only to get entangled in the crime world. Experience an untold side of Moroccan society in a vibrant, stylized world full of challenges and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/ddef22eb7cb8f6fad2764b10e878aa02.poster.avif?t=1748773862\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/ddef22eb7cb8f6fad2764b10e878aa02.webm?t=1748773862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/ddef22eb7cb8f6fad2764b10e878aa02.mp4?t=1748773862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This open-world brings a fresh perspective to urban life in Morocco, shedding light on struggles, dreams, and the harsh realities of the streets. As you rise through the ranks, you\u2019ll have to make tough decisions\u2014stick to your music or give in to the temptations of crime. Every choice shapes your path in a world where survival isn\u2019t guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/6ab49ecb6564990c77ceca54ff8a892d.poster.avif?t=1748773862\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/6ab49ecb6564990c77ceca54ff8a892d.webm?t=1748773862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/6ab49ecb6564990c77ceca54ff8a892d.mp4?t=1748773862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its innovative art style and colorful environments, <i>Hood Tales Part 1: Morocco</i> blends a unique visual identity with immersive gameplay. Explore the city, hustle to survive, and carve out your destiny in a world that\u2019s as stylish as it is unforgiving. Will you escape the cycle, or will the streets pull you in? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/db3c2fd14827e4fb7fabb5149b56476c.poster.avif?t=1748773862\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/db3c2fd14827e4fb7fabb5149b56476c.webm?t=1748773862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/db3c2fd14827e4fb7fabb5149b56476c.mp4?t=1748773862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the streets of Rabat in <i>Hood Tales Part 1: Morocco</i>. Follow the journey of a young artist trying to escape the hood through music, only to get entangled in the crime world. Experience an untold side of Moroccan society in a vibrant, stylized world full of challenges and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/ddef22eb7cb8f6fad2764b10e878aa02.poster.avif?t=1748773862\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/ddef22eb7cb8f6fad2764b10e878aa02.webm?t=1748773862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/ddef22eb7cb8f6fad2764b10e878aa02.mp4?t=1748773862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This open-world brings a fresh perspective to urban life in Morocco, shedding light on struggles, dreams, and the harsh realities of the streets. As you rise through the ranks, you\u2019ll have to make tough decisions\u2014stick to your music or give in to the temptations of crime. Every choice shapes your path in a world where survival isn\u2019t guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/6ab49ecb6564990c77ceca54ff8a892d.poster.avif?t=1748773862\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/6ab49ecb6564990c77ceca54ff8a892d.webm?t=1748773862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/6ab49ecb6564990c77ceca54ff8a892d.mp4?t=1748773862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its innovative art style and colorful environments, <i>Hood Tales Part 1: Morocco</i> blends a unique visual identity with immersive gameplay. Explore the city, hustle to survive, and carve out your destiny in a world that\u2019s as stylish as it is unforgiving. Will you escape the cycle, or will the streets pull you in? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/db3c2fd14827e4fb7fabb5149b56476c.poster.avif?t=1748773862\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/db3c2fd14827e4fb7fabb5149b56476c.webm?t=1748773862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578550/extras/db3c2fd14827e4fb7fabb5149b56476c.mp4?t=1748773862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
